'''Arven''' (Japanese: '''ペパー''' ''Peper'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Flip a coin. If heads, put a random {{TCGP|Item card}} from your deck into your hand. If tails, put a random {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool card}} from your deck into your hand.
}}

